      "canonical_latex": "d\\mathbf{u} = \\frac{\\Gamma}{4\\pi}\\frac{d\\mathbf{l}\\times\\mathbf{r}}{\\|\\mathbf{r}\\|^3} \\implies w_i(y_0) = -\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} \\frac{d\\Gamma/dy}{y_0 - y}\\,dy,\\quad \\alpha_i(y_0) \\approx -\\frac{w_i(y_0)}{U_\\infty} = \\frac{1}{4\\pi U_\\infty}\\int_{-b/2}^{b/2} \\frac{d\\Gamma/dy}{y_0 - y}\\,dy",
